  m_text: "\u2022 Type: Plateau\r\n\u2022 Importance: Mineral wealth, rivers, agriculture,
    heritage.\r\n\u2022 States/Regions: Maharashtra, Karnataka, Telangana, Andhra
    Pradesh.\r\r\n\u2022 Features: Black soil, surrounded by water on all three sides,
    bordered by two mountainranges, the Western Ghats and Eastern Ghats."
