  m_text: "\u2022 Type: Hills\n\u2022 Importance: Rich biodiversity, shifting cultivation
    (jhum), tourism.\n\u2022 States/Regions: Meghalaya, Nagaland, Mizoram, Manipur,
    Tripura.\n\u2022 Features: Bamboo forests, dissected plateau terrain, valleys,
    waterfalls."
